<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
  <title>Nova Solicitação — Domestic</title>
  <style type="text/css">
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
      background-color: #F8FAFC;
      color: #0F172A;
      line-height: 1.6;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }
    .email-wrapper { background-color: #F8FAFC; padding: 16px; width: 100%; }
    .email-container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background-color: #FFFFFF;
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .email-header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1A45E8 0%, #1438CC 100%);
      padding: 40px 32px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .header-icon { font-size: 48px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .email-header h1 {
      color: #FFFFFF;
      font-size: 28px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin: 0 0 8px 0;
    }
    .email-header p {
      color: #C7D4FD;
      font-size: 14px;
      margin: 0;
    }
    .email-body { padding: 40px 32px; }
    .greeting { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; color: #0F172A; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .subtitle { font-size: 15px; color: #475569; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 28px; }
    .request-card {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #EEF2FF 0%, #F0F4FF 100%);
      border: 2px solid #C7D4FD;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 24px;
      margin: 24px 0;
    }
    .request-header { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: #1A45E8; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .request-title { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #0F172A; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .request-details { margin-top: 16px; }
    .detail-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 12px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(26, 69, 232, 0.1);
    }
    .detail-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .detail-label { font-size: 13px; color: #475569; font-weight: 500; }
    .detail-value { font-size: 14px; color: #0F172A; font-weight: 600; }
    .time-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #FEF3C7;
      color: #78350F;
      padding: 6px 12px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-top: 12px;
    }
    .action-section {
      text-align: center;
      margin: 32px 0;
    }
    .cta-button {
      display: inline-block;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1A45E8 0%, #1438CC 100%);
      color: #FFFFFF;
      padding: 14px 44px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 15px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(26, 69, 232, 0.3);
    }
    .cta-button:hover { text-decoration: none; }
    .info-box {
      background: #F1F5F9;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin: 24px 0;
    }
    .info-title { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: #0F172A; margin-bottom: 12px; display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center; }
    .info-title::before { content: 'ℹ️'; }
    .info-text { font-size: 13px; color: #475569; line-height: 1.6; }
    .divider { height: 1px; background: #E2E8F0; margin: 24px 0; }
    .email-footer {
      background-color: #F8FAFC;
      border-top: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
      padding: 28px 32px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .footer-logo { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: #0F172A; margin-bottom: 6px; }
    .footer-text { font-size: 12px; color: #94A3B8; }
    @media only screen and (max-width: 600px) {
      .email-header { padding: 32px 24px; }
      .email-body { padding: 24px 20px; }
      .email-footer { padding: 20px 16px; }
      .request-title { font-size: 18px; }
      .detail-row { flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="email-wrapper">
    <div class="email-container">
      <div class="email-header">
        <div class="header-icon">🎯</div>
        <h1>Nova Solicitação</h1>
        <p>Você tem uma oportunidade de trabalho!</p>
      </div>

      <div class="email-body">
        <p class="greeting">Olá {{provider_name}}! 👋</p>

        <p class="subtitle">
          Um contratante está interessado em seus serviços. Veja os detalhes abaixo:
        </p>

        <!-- Request Card -->
        <div class="request-card">
          <div class="request-header">📋 Detalhes da Solicitação</div>
          <div class="request-title">{{service_name}}</div>

          <div class="request-details">
            <div class="detail-row">
              <span class="detail-label">Contratante</span>
              <span class="detail-value">{{contractor_name}}</span>
            </div>

            {{#if location}}
            <div class="detail-row">
              <span class="detail-label">Local</span>
              <span class="detail-value">{{location}}</span>
            </div>
            {{/if}}

            {{#if scheduled_at}}
            <div class="detail-row">
              <span class="detail-label">Data/Horário</span>
              <span class="detail-value">{{scheduled_at}}</span>
            </div>
            {{/if}}

            {{#if budget}}
            <div class="detail-row">
              <span class="detail-label">Orçamento</span>
              <span class="detail-value">{{budget}}</span>
            </div>
            {{/if}}
          </div>

          {{#if duration}}
          <span class="time-badge">⏱️ Duração estimada: {{duration}}</span>
          {{/if}}
        </div>

        <!-- Action -->
        <div class="action-section">
          <a href="{{request_url}}" class="cta-button">Ver Solicitação Completa</a>
        </div>

        <!-- Info Box -->
        <div class="info-box">
          <div class="info-title">Tempo para responder</div>
          <div class="info-text">
            Responda rapidamente para aumentar suas chances de ser escolhido. Contratantes geralmente escolhem profissionais que respondem em até 2 horas.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="divider"></div>

        <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #94A3B8;">
          💡 Dica: Mantenha seu perfil atualizado e com avaliações positivas para atrair mais solicitações.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="email-footer">
        <div class="footer-logo">Domestic</div>
        <div class="footer-text">© 2026 Domestic. Conectando profissionais e contratantes com confiança.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
